    "His smile makes my skin crawl."

    beau "You would do good to remember that I’ve been running a pack since the last time a Hunt made a true wolf."
    beau "Your great-grandparents were fine folk, Mackenzie. Don’t burn what they built out of impulse."

    "(But...)"
